---
import { BorderBeam } from '@components/magic-ui/border-beam'
import Grille from '@icons/grille.astro'
import MainLayout from '@layouts/MainLayout.astro'
import { Image } from 'astro:assets'
---

<MainLayout description="About Joan Rojas Mejia: my professional journey and my approach as a Product Engineer.">
  <div class="sm:px-4 pt-[14px] flex flex-col justify-center">
    <div class="relative flex flex-col mb-14">
      <div class="text-center max-w-[500px] m-auto px-2 py-6 sm:p-6 flex flex-col items-center">
        <h4
          class="inline-block text-3xl mb-3 font-bold tracking-[-1.2px] bg-repeat bg-clip-text bg-size-[100%] bg-dream-gradient"
          style="-webkit-text-fill-color:transparent"
        >
          About
        </h4>
        <p class="text-lg tracking-[-0.28px] leading-[140%] text-balance">
          A bit about me, my professional journey, and my approach as a developer.
        </p>
        <div class="flex justify-center items-center my-3">
          <Grille className="opacity-20 scale-y-[1] scale-x-[-1]" />
          <span class="w-max flex h-min">
            <Image
              loading="eager"
              class="dark:invert mx-6"
              alt={'dots'}
              src="/three-dots.svg"
              width="35"
              height="35"
            />
          </span>
          <Grille className="opacity-20 " />
        </div>
      </div>
      <section class="mt-[30px]">
        <div class="flex w-full relative rounded-lg">
          <Image
            loading="eager"
            class="rounded-lg"
            alt={'joan photo'}
            src="/about-1.webp"
            width="500"
            height="500"
            class="rounded-lg w-full"
          />
          <BorderBeam size={300} duration={12} delay={9} borderWidth={2} />
        </div>
        <div class="max-w-[600px] mx-auto mt-11">
          <p class="text-base my-3 px-4 leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.25px]">
            I'm a Product Engineer with over 6 years of experience building B2C and B2B products,
            today in fintech. My path started in Web3, developing modules for an NFT game, and grew
            into technical leadership: at Celuweb I was the Full Stack Tech Lead behind a modular
            Clean Architecture platform and mentored the frontend team, and at Tus Trámites VIP I led
            the frontend of a GovTech platform that digitized government procedures in Ecuador. I
            work with technologies such as React, Vue, TypeScript, Next.js, Node.js, Go and MongoDB,
            always with a product mindset and a focus on quality.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base my-3 px-4 leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.25px]">
            In addition to my technical skills, I excel at working both in teams and independently.
            I enjoy collaborating with other professionals, sharing ideas, and finding innovative
            solutions to complex problems. My focus on clear and effective communication has allowed
            me to contribute significantly to projects, not only by providing creative solutions but
            also by helping to maintain a harmonious workflow. I am always looking for opportunities
            to improve and support the team in meeting common goals, adapting to different work
            styles and project needs.
          </p>
          <h4
            class="mt-[54px] opacity-70 dark:text-(--light-gray) tracking-[2px] uppercase text-sm px-4 font-semibold"
          >
            Current
          </h4>
          <p class="text-base my-3 px-4 leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.25px]">
            Since October 2024 I've been a Senior Frontend Developer at Global66. There I built the
            B2B Multienvío (bulk transfers) frontend from scratch, rebuilt the business onboarding
            with identity verification (KYC) and AI reading of corporate documents, and consolidated
            the corporate Design System, taking it from the B2C product to B2B.
          </p>
          <p class="text-base my-3 px-4 leading-[150%] tracking-[-0.25px]">
            Outside of work, since January 2026 I've been studying Economics at Universidad Jorge
            Tadeo Lozano to strengthen the business side of my product vision. I also completed an
            intensive English program at Universidad Pedagógica de Colombia in 2025 (B1 level).
          </p>
          <h4
            class="mt-[54px] opacity-70 dark:text-(--light-gray) tracking-[2px] uppercase text-sm px-4 font-semibold"
          >
            Interactions and mentions
          </h4>
          <div class="px-4 my-3">
            <Image
              loading="eager"
              alt="me"
              src="/mention-1.webp"
              class="rounded-2xl object-cover w-full "
              width={1212}
              height={1260}
            />
          </div>
          <div class="px-4 my-3">
            <Image
              loading="eager"
              alt="me"
              src="/mention-2.webp"
              class="rounded-2xl object-cover w-full "
              width={1212}
              height={1260}
            />
          </div>
          <div class="px-4 my-3">
            <Image
              loading="eager"
              alt="me"
              src="/mention-3.webp"
              class="rounded-2xl object-cover w-full "
              width={1212}
              height={1260}
            />
          </div>
          <div class="px-4 my-3">
            <Image
              loading="eager"
              alt="me"
              src="/mention-4.webp"
              class="rounded-2xl object-cover w-full "
              width={1212}
              height={1260}
            />
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</MainLayout>
